pipeline_split_markdown:
  ok: true
  requests:
    - body:
        json:
          email:
            html: "##&nbsp;Section&nbsp;1<br/><br/>Paragraph&nbsp;1&nbsp;has&nbsp;**bold&nbsp;1**&nbsp;and&nbsp;*italic*&nbsp;words,&nbsp;a&nbsp;[link&nbsp;1](http://example.com/1)&nbsp;and&nbsp;`code&nbsp;1`.&nbsp;Sentences&nbsp;keep&nbsp;going&nbsp;so&nbsp;splitting&nbsp;has&nbsp;to&nbsp;pick&nbsp;a&nbsp;boundary.<br/><br/>-&nbsp;point&nbsp;1a<br/>-&nbsp;point&nbsp;1b<br/><br/>##&nbsp;Section&nbsp;2<br/><br/>Paragraph&nbsp;2&nbsp;has&nbsp;**bold&nbsp;2**&nbsp;and&nbsp;*italic*&nbsp;words,&nbsp;a&nbsp;[link&nbsp;2](http://example.com/2)&nbsp;and&nbsp;`code&nbsp;2`.&nbsp;Sentences&nbsp;keep&nbsp;going&nbsp;so&nbsp;splitting&nbsp;has&nbsp;to&nbsp;pick&nbsp;a&nbsp;boundary.<br/><br/>-&nbsp;point&nbsp;2a<br/>-&nbsp;point&nbsp;2b<br/><br/>##&nbsp;Section&nbsp;3<br/><br/>Paragraph&nbsp;3&nbsp;has&nbsp;**bold&nbsp;3**&nbsp;and&nbsp;*italic*&nbsp;words,&nbsp;a&nbsp;[link&nbsp;3](http://example.com/3)&nbsp;and&nbsp;`code&nbsp;3`.&nbsp;Sentences&nbsp;keep&nbsp;going&nbsp;so&nbsp;splitting&nbsp;has&nbsp;to&nbsp;pick&nbsp;a&nbsp;boundary.<br/><br/>-&nbsp;point&nbsp;3a<br/>-&nbsp;point&nbsp;3b<br/><br/>##&nbsp;Section&nbsp;4<br/><br/>Paragraph&nbsp;4&nbsp;has&nbsp;**bold&nbsp;4**&nbsp;and&nbsp;*italic*&nbsp;words,&nbsp;a&nbsp;[link&nbsp;4](http://example.com/4)&nbsp;and&nbsp;`code&nbsp;4`.&nbsp;Sentences&nbsp;keep&nbsp;going&nbsp;so&nbsp;splitting&nbsp;has&nbsp;to&nbsp;pick&nbsp;a&nbsp;boundary.<br/><br/>-&nbsp;point&nbsp;4a<br/>-&nbsp;point&nbsp;4b<br/><br/>##&nbsp;Section&nbsp;5<br/><br/>Paragraph&nbsp;5&nbsp;has&nbsp;**bold&nbsp;5**&nbsp;and&nbsp;*italic*&nbsp;words,&nbsp;a&nbsp;[link&nbsp;5](http://example.com/5)&nbsp;and&nbsp;`code&nbsp;5`.&nbsp;Sentences&nbsp;keep&nbsp;going&nbsp;so&nbsp;splitting&nbsp;has&nbsp;to&nbsp;pick&nbsp;a&nbsp;boundary.<br/><br/>-&nbsp;point&nbsp;5a<br/>-&nbsp;point&nbsp;5b<br/><br/>##&nbsp;Section&nbsp;6<br/><br/>Paragraph&nbsp;6&nbsp;has&nbsp;**bold&nbsp;6**&nbsp;and&nbsp;*italic*&nbsp;words,&nbsp;a&nbsp;[link&nbsp;6](http://example.com/6)&nbsp